{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../encryption/", "title": "auth0_api_python.encryption"}, "next": {"link": "../token_store/", "title": "auth0_api_python.token_store"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.errors", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.errors\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-errors\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.errors<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.errors\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Custom exceptions for auth0-api-python SDK with HTTP response metadata</p>\n<section id=\"exceptions\">\n<h2>Exceptions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#exceptions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.BaseAuthError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.BaseAuthError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseAuthError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for all auth errors with HTTP response metadata.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MissingRequiredArgumentError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a required argument is missing.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.VerifyAccessTokenError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.VerifyAccessTokenError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">VerifyAccessTokenError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when verifying the access token fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.AuthServerUnavailableError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.AuthServerUnavailableError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthServerUnavailableError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when the OIDC discovery document or JWKS cannot be reached.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.MissingOrganizationError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.MissingOrganizationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MissingOrganizationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when organization_policy is 'required' but the token has no org_id claim.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.OrganizationNotAllowedError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.OrganizationNotAllowedError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OrganizationNotAllowedError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when the token's org_id claim is not in the organization_id allowlist.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.InvalidAuthSchemeError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.InvalidAuthSchemeError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InvalidAuthSchemeError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when the provided authentication scheme is unsupported.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.InvalidDpopProofError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.InvalidDpopProofError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InvalidDpopProofError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when validating a DPoP proof fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.MissingAuthorizationError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.MissingAuthorizationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MissingAuthorizationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Authorization header is missing, empty, or malformed.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.GetAccessTokenForConnectionError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.GetAccessTokenForConnectionError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GetAccessTokenForConnectionError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when getting a token for a connection fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.GetTokenByExchangeProfileError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.GetTokenByExchangeProfileError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GetTokenByExchangeProfileError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when getting a token via exchange profile fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.GetClientCredentialsTokenError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.GetClientCredentialsTokenError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GetClientCredentialsTokenError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a client credentials token request fails before the network call.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.ApiError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.ApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ApiError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when an API request to Auth0 fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.ConfigurationError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.ConfigurationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConfigurationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when SDK configuration is invalid.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.DomainsResolverError\" title=\"auth0_api_python.errors.DomainsResolverError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when domains resolver function fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.errors.BaseAuthError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.errors.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseAuthError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.errors.BaseAuthError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></code></p>\n<p>Base class for all auth errors with HTTP response metadata.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\